## Implementation Notes for Codex (P1)
- 3-bar check: `iClose(D1,1)>iHigh(D1,2) && iClose(D1,2)>iHigh(D1,3) && iClose(D1,3)>iHigh(D1,4)` for bearish trap
- Set bool `bear_trap_day4 = true` at D1 bar open
- M5 EMA20: `iMA(NULL,PERIOD_M5,20,0,MODE_EMA,PRICE_CLOSE,0)` and `...,1`
- Entry condition: `Close[0] < EMA20[0] AND Close[1] >= EMA20[1]` — this bar closed below, prior bar was above
- P3 sweeps: EMA period (13/20/34), pattern bars (2/3/4), TP (30/50/75), SL (15/20/25 pips)

